<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco Systems raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco Systems raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Group Inc said analyst Michael Karfopoulos upgraded Cisco Systems Inc to short-term buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said the long-term rating is unchanged at buy.</p>
<p>-- said raised the 1997 earnings estimate to $2.04 a share from $2.02 a share and increased the 1998 estimate to $2.70 a share from $2.66 a share.</p>
<p>-- said the short-term price target is $70 a share.</p>
<p>-- Cisco gained 2-1/8 to 59-3/8.</p>
</text>
